1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:04,587
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:05,338 --> 00:00:06,673
[gunshots]

3
00:00:06,756 --> 00:00:07,966
[gun clicks, fires]

4
00:00:09,426 --> 00:00:10,677
[whoosh, slashing sounds]

5
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,679
[machine gun fire]

6
00:00:12,762 --> 00:00:14,681
[machine gun fire continues]

7
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:15,765
[single gunshot]

8
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:20,395
[rapid gunfire]

9
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,397
[echoing blast]

10
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,107
[rapid gunfire]

11
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:25,942
[blade whooshing]

12
00:00:26,025 --> 00:00:28,445
[tense music builds]

13
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:29,696
[blade whooshing]

14
00:00:32,282 --> 00:00:34,868
[Emilia] <i>Hi, Papa.</i>
<i>Your favorite daughter is back.</i>

15
00:00:34,951 --> 00:00:37,787
<i>And by the way, I've already</i>
<i>gained the Triad's support.</i>

16
00:00:38,204 --> 00:00:40,999
[Lily] <i>Even if it takes us months,</i>
<i>years, or decades,</i>

17
00:00:41,082 --> 00:00:42,792
<i>we'll find that mass grave.</i>

18
00:00:42,876 --> 00:00:47,088
<i>We'll find the victims</i>
<i>and help their surviving families.</i>

19
00:00:47,172 --> 00:00:49,716
[Julio] <i>The only time</i>
<i>they'll see that mass grave</i>

20
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:55,055
<i>is when their corpses are</i>
<i>on their way down into that pit.</i>

21
00:00:55,138 --> 00:00:56,598
<i>But before that happens,</i>

22
00:00:56,681 --> 00:01:00,018
<i>I want the people of Ardiente to witness</i>

23
00:01:00,101 --> 00:01:05,148
<i>how I'll mete out my punishment</i>
<i>and wrath on Lily and Diego.</i>

24
00:01:05,231 --> 00:01:06,024
[Diego] <i>Be careful.</i>

25
00:01:06,107 --> 00:01:09,611
<i>I wish I could stay by your side</i>
<i>so I could protect you.</i>

26
00:01:09,694 --> 00:01:10,695
<i>But this will help so many.</i>

27
00:01:10,779 --> 00:01:12,697
<i>And once we find that mass grave,</i>

28
00:01:12,781 --> 00:01:15,742
<i>this will be the biggest case</i>
<i>Julio Ardiente will face.</i>

29
00:01:15,825 --> 00:01:17,160
[screaming]

30
00:01:17,243 --> 00:01:19,204
[goon] <i>Who called this meeting?!</i>

31
00:01:19,662 --> 00:01:20,580
-[grunt]
-[gunshot]

32
00:01:20,663 --> 00:01:23,666
[gunshots]

33
00:01:24,334 --> 00:01:25,376
[Jepoy] <i>Anna!</i>

34
00:01:25,460 --> 00:01:26,795
[grunts]

35
00:01:27,086 --> 00:01:28,463
[Marlon] <i>Anna? Anna, wake up.</i>

36
00:01:28,546 --> 00:01:30,757
[Anna] <i>So, you weren't the one</i>
<i>who saved me first.</i>

37
00:01:31,674 --> 00:01:34,093
[Lily] <i>The mass grave</i>
<i>could be around here.</i>

38
00:01:34,177 --> 00:01:35,470
<i>This is where we're headed.</i>

39
00:01:37,639 --> 00:01:39,974
-[gunshots]
-[Lily] <i>Get away from here!</i>

40
00:01:40,058 --> 00:01:42,393
<i>Find Diego and tell him</i>
<i>Julio's men ambushed us.</i>

41
00:01:42,477 --> 00:01:44,854
<i>-I can't just leave you--</i>
<i>-Mom, I'll be right behind you.</i>

42
00:01:44,938 --> 00:01:45,855
[thump]

43
00:01:45,939 --> 00:01:47,690
[Magbanua] <i>Governor, we have Lily Cruz.</i>

44
00:01:49,567 --> 00:01:50,568
[groans]

45
00:01:56,199 --> 00:01:59,160
Diego! The Ardientes have Lily Cruz.

46
00:01:59,744 --> 00:02:00,745
What?

47
00:02:01,955 --> 00:02:06,626
[somber choral music playing]

48
00:02:09,879 --> 00:02:13,800
-[tense music playing]
-[Camia breathes heavily]

49
00:02:13,883 --> 00:02:15,385
[phone ringing]

50
00:02:16,636 --> 00:02:17,846
[phone ringing]

51
00:02:18,888 --> 00:02:20,515
-[heavy breathing]
-[phone ringing]

52
00:02:23,893 --> 00:02:24,769
Diego…

53
00:02:28,064 --> 00:02:29,149
What?!

54
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:30,859
[panicked breathing]

55
00:02:30,942 --> 00:02:31,985
They took her?!

56
00:02:32,861 --> 00:02:34,028
Diego!

57
00:02:34,112 --> 00:02:36,573
[panicked breathing]

58
00:02:37,740 --> 00:02:40,702
[tense music playing]

59
00:02:40,785 --> 00:02:41,703
[thuds]

60
00:02:43,329 --> 00:02:44,998
[Magbanua] Go on. Bring her inside.

61
00:02:49,335 --> 00:02:57,302
[tense music playing]

62
00:03:00,930 --> 00:03:06,185
[ominous music playing]

63
00:03:11,274 --> 00:03:12,317
[groans]

64
00:03:19,115 --> 00:03:20,116
[sighs]

65
00:03:21,743 --> 00:03:22,744
[grunts]

66
00:03:41,429 --> 00:03:42,555
[Magbanua] Governor.

67
00:03:44,849 --> 00:03:48,519
[ominous music swells]

68
00:03:57,779 --> 00:03:59,239
[ominous music fades]

69
00:04:00,531 --> 00:04:02,283
Lily Cruz.

70
00:04:04,786 --> 00:04:05,828
Well, Lily…

71
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,164
We meet again.

72
00:04:09,123 --> 00:04:11,751
Aren't you going to try and break free?

73
00:04:12,210 --> 00:04:13,628
Aren't you going to scream?

74
00:04:13,962 --> 00:04:17,340
"Julio, you monster! You're despicable!"

75
00:04:20,093 --> 00:04:21,135
No words?!

76
00:04:25,473 --> 00:04:26,474
[grunts] You know…

77
00:04:27,183 --> 00:04:29,894
There are only two kinds of people

78
00:04:29,978 --> 00:04:33,773
who would do this silent treatment

79
00:04:33,856 --> 00:04:35,566
like you're doing right now.

80
00:04:36,526 --> 00:04:37,610
Those…

81
00:04:38,027 --> 00:04:40,655
who are extremely stupid…

82
00:04:41,864 --> 00:04:43,032
and those…

83
00:04:43,783 --> 00:04:46,244
who are extremely guilty.

84
00:04:47,370 --> 00:04:50,790
Which one are you, Lily Cruz?

85
00:04:51,791 --> 00:04:52,709
-Well?!
-[thump]

86
00:04:58,464 --> 00:05:00,133
-[Magbanua grunts]
-Wake her up.

87
00:05:00,758 --> 00:05:01,843
[grunts]

88
00:05:02,135 --> 00:05:04,637
I don't want her unconscious.

89
00:05:04,721 --> 00:05:05,722
[grunts]

90
00:05:07,724 --> 00:05:08,975
I'm not guilty.

91
00:05:09,434 --> 00:05:11,227
I didn't kill your grandson.

92
00:05:11,311 --> 00:05:13,938
He killed himself
like the damned animal he was.

93
00:05:14,856 --> 00:05:16,607
My grandson turned into that…

94
00:05:17,066 --> 00:05:18,359
because of you!

95
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,403
It's your fault!

96
00:05:20,486 --> 00:05:21,863
You seduced him.

97
00:05:22,322 --> 00:05:24,866
You made him fall in love with you

98
00:05:24,949 --> 00:05:26,743
and toyed with him.

99
00:05:26,826 --> 00:05:31,164
You broke his heart and ruined his life.

100
00:05:31,622 --> 00:05:33,374
That's why, Lily Cruz…

101
00:05:33,791 --> 00:05:35,543
You killed Arnaldo!

102
00:05:35,626 --> 00:05:37,879
-I didn't kill your grandson!
-You killed him!

103
00:05:37,962 --> 00:05:40,256
Is it that hard to accept, Julio?!

104
00:05:41,591 --> 00:05:44,469
He killed himself with his own gun!

105
00:05:44,552 --> 00:05:47,305
Your beloved grandson killed himself

106
00:05:47,388 --> 00:05:49,891
because he couldn't stand
becoming the monster

107
00:05:49,974 --> 00:05:51,267
you turned him into.

108
00:05:51,350 --> 00:05:54,604
Truth is, you're the one
who killed your own grandson!

109
00:05:54,812 --> 00:05:56,022
Enough!

110
00:05:56,272 --> 00:05:57,815
[tense music playing]

111
00:06:05,406 --> 00:06:08,034
You deserved every bit of pain
I inflicted on you

112
00:06:08,117 --> 00:06:11,245
after everything you did to my family!

113
00:06:12,872 --> 00:06:15,750
So, we're right back where we started.

114
00:06:16,793 --> 00:06:19,253
Emilia killed your father.

115
00:06:21,005 --> 00:06:22,757
Then, you killed my grandson!

116
00:06:23,674 --> 00:06:25,968
And so, you got your revenge.

117
00:06:26,928 --> 00:06:28,387
And now, I will get mine.

118
00:06:29,555 --> 00:06:32,809
Have you looked
into a mirror lately, Lily Cruz?

119
00:06:33,184 --> 00:06:35,394
Don't be surprised if you see me
staring back at you.

120
00:06:36,104 --> 00:06:39,857
If you think I'm despicable,
then so are you.

121
00:06:39,941 --> 00:06:42,068
You're standing in the same quagmire

122
00:06:42,151 --> 00:06:44,070
I'm supposed to be standing in right now.

123
00:06:44,821 --> 00:06:46,364
You've become despicable yourself

124
00:06:46,447 --> 00:06:50,451
because you became a murderer
when you killed Arnaldo!

125
00:06:50,827 --> 00:06:52,995
[tense music playing]

126
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:56,040
[strained voice] Have you ever felt pain?

127
00:06:57,667 --> 00:07:01,754
No, you never felt pain
like I have felt it.

128
00:07:03,798 --> 00:07:07,969
But I will make sure
that you will feel pain…

129
00:07:09,428 --> 00:07:11,681
because I'll make you suffer…

130
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:14,976
and I'm going to enjoy watching it.

131
00:07:15,059 --> 00:07:16,185
[sniffles]

132
00:07:16,477 --> 00:07:21,732
[sobbing] I will make you suffer
the way I'm suffering right now.

133
00:07:21,816 --> 00:07:24,861
[tense music playing]

134
00:07:25,278 --> 00:07:26,988
Lily Cruz…

135
00:07:28,364 --> 00:07:30,032
What did you say you were again?

136
00:07:30,950 --> 00:07:36,581
"Lily Cruz, I'm made of gold
because I am indestructible"?!

137
00:07:39,333 --> 00:07:43,588
Well, I am going to be the one
to destroy you…

138
00:07:44,338 --> 00:07:46,966
and I will enjoy every minute of it.

139
00:07:48,426 --> 00:07:49,969
This is a promise:

140
00:07:50,428 --> 00:07:51,429
[sniffling]

141
00:07:51,804 --> 00:07:53,139
You will suffer!

142
00:07:53,764 --> 00:08:00,229
[suspenseful music playing]

143
00:08:02,940 --> 00:08:09,238
[tense music playing]

144
00:08:10,448 --> 00:08:13,201
Wow, Stefano. What a surprise.

145
00:08:15,203 --> 00:08:17,038
Why did you invite me here?

146
00:08:19,957 --> 00:08:20,958
Have a seat.

147
00:08:24,504 --> 00:08:30,927
[tense music playing]

148
00:08:44,607 --> 00:08:46,901
I just want to get to know
you better, Emilia.

149
00:08:48,611 --> 00:08:49,654
Thank you.

150
00:08:56,118 --> 00:08:58,079
[wine trickling]

151
00:09:02,291 --> 00:09:04,544
But you know that I'm married, right?

152
00:09:06,128 --> 00:09:07,213
We do.

153
00:09:08,381 --> 00:09:09,549
[scoffs softly]

154
00:09:09,632 --> 00:09:12,969
I was given an important
assignment by the Triad.

155
00:09:15,137 --> 00:09:16,722
I'm looking for a new partner…

156
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:18,516
who I can trust.

157
00:09:24,855 --> 00:09:25,898
Cheers.

158
00:09:28,651 --> 00:09:29,860
[tense music playing]

159
00:09:29,944 --> 00:09:31,028
[man] Listen up, everyone!

160
00:09:31,112 --> 00:09:34,156
The Governor wants us
to head over to the plaza.

161
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,992
He said they will bring Lily Cruz there

162
00:09:36,075 --> 00:09:38,327
and punish her for murdering our mayor!

163
00:09:38,411 --> 00:09:40,580
Let us show our support for the Ardientes!

164
00:09:40,663 --> 00:09:42,957
We'll be one with the Ardientes!

165
00:09:43,624 --> 00:09:45,668
-Let's support the Ardientes!
-[crowd clamoring]

166
00:09:46,002 --> 00:09:47,753
-Come on!
-Let's go!

167
00:09:48,296 --> 00:09:49,964
[Diego] <i>I won't give up, Lily.</i>

168
00:09:50,798 --> 00:09:52,008
<i>I will save you.</i>

169
00:09:53,092 --> 00:09:54,010
[tense music playing]

170
00:09:54,093 --> 00:09:56,095
You don't have to worry
about anything, Stefano,

171
00:09:56,178 --> 00:09:57,555
least of all, my father.

172
00:09:57,888 --> 00:10:00,349
Just so you know,
he's at my mercy right now,

173
00:10:00,433 --> 00:10:03,144
so no matter what, he'll agree
to the Triad's plans.

174
00:10:06,981 --> 00:10:09,400
If Red Dragon's daughter
really is ferocious,

175
00:10:10,860 --> 00:10:13,946
then we are unstoppable together.

176
00:10:15,031 --> 00:10:17,033
My mama taught me very well.

177
00:10:17,116 --> 00:10:19,201
[tense music playing]

178
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:20,953
[phone ringing]

179
00:10:22,538 --> 00:10:24,081
-Oh.
-[phone ringing]

180
00:10:25,416 --> 00:10:26,334
Hello?

181
00:10:26,417 --> 00:10:27,668
Emilia…

182
00:10:28,753 --> 00:10:31,547
Get your big behind up here.

183
00:10:33,382 --> 00:10:34,425
[Julio] <i>Yes.</i>

184
00:10:35,426 --> 00:10:37,637
<i>We have her again.</i>

185
00:10:38,179 --> 00:10:42,808
The indestructible Lily Cruz.

186
00:10:45,519 --> 00:10:47,229
But from where I stand…

187
00:10:48,356 --> 00:10:50,608
she doesn't look so indestruct--

188
00:10:50,691 --> 00:10:52,610
[walking canes clatter]

189
00:10:53,027 --> 00:10:54,070
[Julio scoffs]

190
00:10:54,403 --> 00:10:55,863
A little feisty, maybe.

191
00:10:57,615 --> 00:10:58,658
Okay, Papa.

192
00:10:58,949 --> 00:11:02,286
[tense music playing]

193
00:11:06,624 --> 00:11:07,792
[wailing]

194
00:11:10,127 --> 00:11:12,296
[sniffles] Madrigal…

195
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:19,261
I have never loved anyone
as much as I love you.

196
00:11:19,345 --> 00:11:20,388
[crying]

197
00:11:26,602 --> 00:11:27,603
[sniffles]

198
00:11:28,854 --> 00:11:30,981
I've loved so many men.

199
00:11:34,235 --> 00:11:36,695
I've been with so many men.

200
00:11:38,948 --> 00:11:40,282
[sobbing]

201
00:11:40,908 --> 00:11:44,078
But I've never cried for anyone.

202
00:11:46,664 --> 00:11:49,875
What's holding us back, huh?

203
00:11:51,502 --> 00:11:55,589
What's stopping you from loving me?

204
00:11:56,173 --> 00:11:57,091
Huh?!

205
00:11:57,508 --> 00:11:59,176
<i>I love you, Madrigal.</i>

206
00:11:59,260 --> 00:12:00,803
<i>I love you too, Anna.</i>

207
00:12:01,929 --> 00:12:03,222
<i>What?!</i>

208
00:12:03,305 --> 00:12:05,224
<i>Did you say "Anna"?!</i>

209
00:12:06,517 --> 00:12:07,852
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

210
00:12:12,356 --> 00:12:13,399
Anna?

211
00:12:14,650 --> 00:12:15,693
Anna?!

212
00:12:17,736 --> 00:12:18,779
Huh?

213
00:12:20,531 --> 00:12:24,869
She's the one getting
in the way of our relationship?

214
00:12:30,207 --> 00:12:34,086
I know what I have to do
to get rid of her…

215
00:12:36,964 --> 00:12:38,549
and make you love me.

216
00:12:42,678 --> 00:12:46,056
I know exactly what to do.

217
00:12:48,476 --> 00:12:51,937
[unsettling music playing]

218
00:12:52,771 --> 00:12:53,731
Auntie Camia.

219
00:12:53,814 --> 00:12:54,773
-Jepoy.
-Auntie Camia.

220
00:12:54,857 --> 00:12:56,692
I got your message. What happened?

221
00:12:57,193 --> 00:12:58,235
-Jepoy--
-Where's Lily?

222
00:12:58,402 --> 00:12:59,528
I don't know, either.

223
00:12:59,945 --> 00:13:01,864
But I'm supposed to meet Diego here.

224
00:13:02,239 --> 00:13:09,079
[unsettling music playing]

225
00:13:15,544 --> 00:13:16,545
[car door opens]

226
00:13:16,962 --> 00:13:18,380
-Jepoy! Mom!
-Where's Lily?

227
00:13:18,756 --> 00:13:21,300
Diego, where's Lily? Where's my daughter?

228
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:24,470
The Ardientes have her.
They're taking her to the plaza.

229
00:13:24,553 --> 00:13:25,513
I'll go save her.

230
00:13:25,930 --> 00:13:27,765
What will they do to Lily?

231
00:13:28,724 --> 00:13:29,767
Mom…

232
00:13:32,478 --> 00:13:33,687
[Emilia] Dad?

233
00:13:34,396 --> 00:13:36,106
-Dad.
-Emilia.

234
00:13:38,192 --> 00:13:39,985
Took you long enough to get back.

235
00:13:40,069 --> 00:13:42,988
So, where is that
indestructible Lily Cruz?

236
00:13:43,072 --> 00:13:49,453
[tense music playing]

237
00:13:55,376 --> 00:13:57,545
You murderer!

238
00:13:58,837 --> 00:14:01,048
-You're a murderer!
-Emilia!

239
00:14:01,131 --> 00:14:02,633
Emilia, calm down.

240
00:14:03,217 --> 00:14:04,385
Emilia, stop it!

241
00:14:05,219 --> 00:14:06,095
Emilia!

242
00:14:07,346 --> 00:14:08,764
Calm down.

243
00:14:12,476 --> 00:14:14,103
You will get your chance.

244
00:14:15,312 --> 00:14:19,233
Tomorrow is the big day.

245
00:14:20,067 --> 00:14:21,777
[tense music playing]

246
00:14:23,279 --> 00:14:25,197
[chuckling]

247
00:14:26,031 --> 00:14:26,949
Relax.

248
00:14:27,741 --> 00:14:31,537
[tense music playing]

249
00:14:34,123 --> 00:14:35,416
No matter what happens,

250
00:14:35,499 --> 00:14:37,376
we'll push through with Lily's plan.

251
00:14:37,459 --> 00:14:39,003
We will reveal everything.

252
00:14:39,253 --> 00:14:41,463
Diego, please save my daughter.

253
00:14:41,881 --> 00:14:42,882
Don't worry.

254
00:14:43,257 --> 00:14:44,675
Even if it means giving up my life,

255
00:14:44,758 --> 00:14:46,260
I'll do it just to save her.

256
00:14:46,677 --> 00:14:48,637
Jepoy, take her back home.

257
00:14:48,721 --> 00:14:50,264
-I'm on it.
-Bye, Mom. Take care.

258
00:14:51,599 --> 00:14:52,808
[car engine starts]

259
00:15:00,983 --> 00:15:02,484
Jepoy, it's time.

260
00:15:03,152 --> 00:15:05,946
We must execute Lily's plans now.

261
00:15:12,912 --> 00:15:13,996
<i>Are we going?</i>

262
00:15:15,831 --> 00:15:17,958
<i>We need to support Diego.</i>

263
00:15:18,667 --> 00:15:21,587
<i>We beat the Ardientes at their own game.</i>

264
00:15:21,962 --> 00:15:25,633
<i>Now, I'm sure those monsters</i>
<i>are mustering their forces</i>

265
00:15:25,716 --> 00:15:27,217
<i>so they can retaliate against us.</i>

266
00:15:27,301 --> 00:15:29,011
<i>But before that happens,</i>

267
00:15:29,094 --> 00:15:32,348
<i>we have to go all out</i>
<i>to ensure their downfall.</i>

268
00:15:33,015 --> 00:15:34,016
<i>What are you planning?</i>

269
00:15:34,475 --> 00:15:36,852
<i>You should stay behind</i>
<i>when we go to Raul's funeral.</i>

270
00:15:37,728 --> 00:15:39,313
<i>What I want you to do</i>

271
00:15:39,396 --> 00:15:44,068
<i>is go to every witness we have</i>
<i>against the Ardientes.</i>

272
00:15:44,151 --> 00:15:47,529
<i>Tell them that now is the time</i>
<i>to face their fears</i>

273
00:15:47,613 --> 00:15:48,864
<i>and come out of hiding.</i>

274
00:15:49,281 --> 00:15:55,996
<i>Because we'll unearth every</i>
<i>horrible thing the Ardientes did</i>

275
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:59,500
<i>so that the people can finally</i>
<i>exact their revenge on them.</i>

276
00:16:04,964 --> 00:16:06,423
<i>What are you doing here?</i>

277
00:16:06,507 --> 00:16:07,841
<i>Lily has a message for you.</i>

278
00:16:09,009 --> 00:16:11,220
<i>She's about to bring down the Ardientes.</i>

279
00:16:11,971 --> 00:16:14,056
<i>But she needs your help</i>
<i>in order to do that.</i>

280
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:17,559
<i>We all know that you sold</i>
<i>your soul to those devils.</i>

281
00:16:18,477 --> 00:16:20,938
<i>This is your chance to get it back.</i>

282
00:16:21,897 --> 00:16:23,941
<i>This is your chance to stop living in fear</i>

283
00:16:24,942 --> 00:16:26,276
<i>and start living freely.</i>

284
00:16:27,111 --> 00:16:30,197
<i>Now is the time to atone</i>
<i>for your mistakes.</i>

285
00:16:30,906 --> 00:16:32,449
<i>If we all work together,</i>

286
00:16:32,533 --> 00:16:36,161
<i>there's no doubt that we can</i>
<i>take the Ardientes down.</i>

287
00:16:37,079 --> 00:16:40,374
<i>We can finally give justice</i>
<i>to all their victims.</i>

288
00:16:41,959 --> 00:16:43,502
<i>Can we count on you to help us?</i>

289
00:16:49,008 --> 00:16:52,553
<i>To exact justice from the Ardientes?</i>

290
00:16:54,263 --> 00:16:56,306
[laughing]

291
00:16:56,390 --> 00:16:57,725
<i>Are you joking?!</i>

292
00:16:58,183 --> 00:16:59,560
<i>Are you kidding me?!</i>

293
00:17:00,060 --> 00:17:01,687
<i>It's never going to happen!</i>

294
00:17:02,563 --> 00:17:07,151
<i>The Ardientes have been ruling</i>
<i>over this land for all time.</i>

295
00:17:08,110 --> 00:17:14,992
<i>And you have been selflessly</i>
<i>fighting this war for all your life.</i>

296
00:17:16,910 --> 00:17:18,245
<i>Have you accomplished anything?</i>

297
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:20,247
<i>You haven't, have you?</i>

298
00:17:20,330 --> 00:17:24,626
[scoffs] <i>So, why should I believe you?</i>

299
00:17:25,169 --> 00:17:26,003
<i>Hmm?</i>

300
00:17:26,837 --> 00:17:28,547
<i>Why should I trust you?</i>

301
00:17:29,590 --> 00:17:33,552
<i>You know that all I want</i>
<i>is justice for my father.</i>

302
00:17:34,511 --> 00:17:37,222
<i>But I'm not going to fall into</i>
<i>your empty promises.</i>

303
00:17:38,265 --> 00:17:40,309
<i>I'm not promising you anything, Natalie.</i>

304
00:17:41,101 --> 00:17:42,603
<i>But I will tell you this:</i>

305
00:17:43,812 --> 00:17:47,524
<i>You'll never get justice for your father</i>
<i>unless we all work together.</i>

306
00:17:49,109 --> 00:17:51,236
<i>We have to help each other</i>
<i>and stand united</i>

307
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:53,697
<i>against the Ardientes once and for all.</i>

308
00:17:55,741 --> 00:17:56,867
<i>Jepoy…</i>

309
00:17:57,367 --> 00:18:01,955
<i>You want us to join forces</i>
<i>against the Ardientes?</i>

310
00:18:02,623 --> 00:18:03,499
<i>Yes.</i>

311
00:18:04,374 --> 00:18:08,754
<i>And you want me to help Anna and Lily?</i>

312
00:18:11,673 --> 00:18:15,928
<i>You want me to connive</i>

313
00:18:16,428 --> 00:18:19,848
<i>with Anna and Lily?</i>

314
00:18:19,932 --> 00:18:22,434
[laughing]

315
00:18:22,518 --> 00:18:24,853
<i>I feel like I'm talking to a crazy man.</i>

316
00:18:26,605 --> 00:18:28,440
<i>Well, let me remind you.</i>

317
00:18:29,108 --> 00:18:32,236
<i>Anna's the woman that you're crazy for.</i>

318
00:18:33,278 --> 00:18:35,155
<i>And Ivy…</i>

319
00:18:35,239 --> 00:18:36,949
<i>I'm sorry, Lily…</i>

320
00:18:37,032 --> 00:18:39,368
<i>was the woman Arnaldo was crazy for.</i>

321
00:18:39,952 --> 00:18:44,873
<i>So, why would I join forces with you guys</i>

322
00:18:46,041 --> 00:18:47,793
<i>to get what I want?</i>

323
00:18:47,876 --> 00:18:49,670
[chuckles] <i>It makes no sense.</i>

324
00:18:49,753 --> 00:18:51,505
<i>It's never going to happen.</i>

325
00:18:51,588 --> 00:18:54,091
<i>-Natalie, please--</i>
<i>-Not in your wildest dreams!</i>

326
00:18:54,174 --> 00:18:55,467
<i>Natalie, listen to me!</i>

327
00:18:56,093 --> 00:18:58,428
<i>Let's set aside our personal issues.</i>

328
00:18:58,512 --> 00:19:00,681
<i>We all want the same thing,</i>
<i>and that's justice!</i>

329
00:19:02,141 --> 00:19:04,643
<i>The reason why we can't win against them</i>

330
00:19:04,726 --> 00:19:06,436
<i>is that we're all divided!</i>

331
00:19:08,147 --> 00:19:09,523
<i>Let's help each other.</i>

332
00:19:10,357 --> 00:19:11,567
<i>Why don't we join forces?</i>

333
00:19:13,026 --> 00:19:17,197
[slow tense music playing]

334
00:19:18,782 --> 00:19:21,160
<i>Natalie, I'm counting on you</i>
<i>to do the right thing.</i>

335
00:19:23,412 --> 00:19:24,454
<i>Do it…</i>

336
00:19:26,373 --> 00:19:27,416
<i>for your father.</i>

337
00:19:36,758 --> 00:19:39,011
-We need to hurry--
-Jepoy! Ms. Camia!

338
00:19:39,344 --> 00:19:41,388
We heard about what happened to Lily.

339
00:19:41,763 --> 00:19:42,890
We're here to help.

340
00:19:44,308 --> 00:19:45,893
I'll get our witnesses ready.

341
00:19:45,976 --> 00:19:50,772
But the Ardientes will just
fool their supporters again.

342
00:19:50,856 --> 00:19:54,818
We need strong evidence of
the Ardientes' heinous crimes.

343
00:19:54,902 --> 00:19:55,944
-That's right.
-Exactly.

344
00:19:56,028 --> 00:19:59,156
I saw some skeletons
in the woods of San Bartolome.

345
00:19:59,907 --> 00:20:02,951
Let's expose all of
the Ardientes' dastardly deeds.

346
00:20:03,952 --> 00:20:06,496
That may be the only way
for us to save Lily.

347
00:20:06,955 --> 00:20:12,878
[tense music playing]

348
00:20:17,049 --> 00:20:23,889
[tense music playing]

349
00:20:28,727 --> 00:20:31,063
[Lily] <i>I won't let these monsters win.</i>

350
00:20:31,563 --> 00:20:33,232
<i>As long as I'm still alive,</i>

351
00:20:33,315 --> 00:20:35,442
<i>I'll always have an ace up my sleeve.</i>

352
00:20:42,532 --> 00:20:44,868
<i>I will not go down without a fight.</i>

353
00:20:47,329 --> 00:20:48,372
Let's go.

354
00:20:48,789 --> 00:20:55,837
[suspenseful music playing]

355
00:21:07,724 --> 00:21:11,603
[tense music swells]

356
00:21:12,187 --> 00:21:13,230
[car door closes]

357
00:21:17,734 --> 00:21:25,367
[unsettling music playing]

358
00:21:28,537 --> 00:21:29,955
JUSTICE FOR THE MAYOR

359
00:21:30,038 --> 00:21:31,331
ARREST LILY CRUZ

360
00:21:41,008 --> 00:21:42,175
-Ben!
-Ben!

361
00:21:42,259 --> 00:21:45,220
Where'd you go? Where were you earlier?

362
00:21:45,762 --> 00:21:47,806
Lily Cruz was kidnapped by the Ardientes.

363
00:21:47,889 --> 00:21:49,266
We need to help her.

364
00:21:49,808 --> 00:21:50,976
[stuttering] Why?

365
00:21:51,059 --> 00:21:54,438
I didn't say I would help you
go against the Ardientes.

366
00:21:54,521 --> 00:21:56,189
I didn't promise you guys anything!

367
00:21:56,690 --> 00:21:57,774
What's that?

368
00:21:58,066 --> 00:21:59,359
Mind your own business.

369
00:21:59,735 --> 00:22:02,237
No matter what you do, you will
never defeat the Ardientes

370
00:22:02,321 --> 00:22:04,865
because they have everything:
money and power.

371
00:22:05,490 --> 00:22:07,075
The Ardientes will only kill you

372
00:22:07,159 --> 00:22:09,077
the same way they killed your loved ones.

373
00:22:09,453 --> 00:22:10,454
Hold on.

374
00:22:10,537 --> 00:22:12,039
Weren't you the one who convinced us

375
00:22:12,122 --> 00:22:13,498
to go against the Ardientes?

376
00:22:13,874 --> 00:22:14,958
Huh?

377
00:22:15,375 --> 00:22:16,626
-Where are you going?!
-Hold on!

378
00:22:16,710 --> 00:22:18,003
Don't touch me!

379
00:22:19,713 --> 00:22:20,839
[Edna gasps]

380
00:22:21,381 --> 00:22:22,966
Ben? What's that?!

381
00:22:24,426 --> 00:22:26,762
Where'd you get that money?!

382
00:22:27,137 --> 00:22:28,764
What did you do, Ben?!

383
00:22:29,139 --> 00:22:32,309
Did you tell Julio about our plans?!

384
00:22:32,392 --> 00:22:33,602
Yes! What do you care?!

385
00:22:34,102 --> 00:22:35,979
All that matters in this world is money!

386
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:38,690
I don't care about your cause.

387
00:22:39,191 --> 00:22:40,150
Ouch!

388
00:22:40,525 --> 00:22:43,070
[Ben groaning in pain]

389
00:22:43,153 --> 00:22:44,529
What's happening to Ben?

390
00:22:45,697 --> 00:22:46,907
I was bitten by a…

391
00:22:49,534 --> 00:22:50,994
-Ben!
-[Ben groaning in pain]

392
00:22:51,078 --> 00:22:52,412
What's happening to him?!

393
00:22:52,496 --> 00:22:53,622
[groans in pain]

394
00:22:53,955 --> 00:22:56,124
[suspenseful music playing]

395
00:22:56,666 --> 00:22:57,709
[Ronald gasps]

396
00:23:05,926 --> 00:23:08,345
<i>Lethal scorpion.</i>

397
00:23:08,929 --> 00:23:09,971
[chuckling]

398
00:23:13,975 --> 00:23:15,018
[chuckles]

399
00:23:15,352 --> 00:23:17,395
<i>For the idiot, Ben.</i>

400
00:23:17,979 --> 00:23:23,902
<i>Does he not know that betrayal</i>
<i>comes with a price?</i>

401
00:23:25,779 --> 00:23:27,030
<i>You three.</i>

402
00:23:27,114 --> 00:23:29,908
<i>The moment the scorpion bites Ben,</i>

403
00:23:30,742 --> 00:23:33,578
<i>take my money back and leave right away.</i>

404
00:23:34,287 --> 00:23:35,956
<i>But before you leave him,</i>

405
00:23:36,748 --> 00:23:39,209
<i>make sure he's dead as a doornail.</i>

406
00:23:39,292 --> 00:23:40,544
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

407
00:23:42,087 --> 00:23:44,589
<i>Do your job, my little pet.</i>

408
00:23:46,967 --> 00:23:48,009
[Ben groaning in pain]

409
00:23:51,972 --> 00:23:53,181
[phone ringing]

410
00:23:55,183 --> 00:23:56,268
[phone ringing]

411
00:23:58,186 --> 00:23:59,062
Jepoy?

412
00:24:00,814 --> 00:24:01,898
What?

413
00:24:02,566 --> 00:24:04,234
Okay, we're on our way.

414
00:24:05,527 --> 00:24:08,738
-What did he say?
-They found the mass grave.

415
00:24:08,822 --> 00:24:10,657
We need to go there right away.

416
00:24:13,451 --> 00:24:17,330
[tense music playing]

417
00:24:32,470 --> 00:24:33,513
[car door opens]

418
00:24:43,940 --> 00:24:44,900
Roll down your window.

419
00:24:46,985 --> 00:24:49,362
Good evening, sir. This is a checkpoint.

420
00:24:49,446 --> 00:24:51,698
Can you please step out for a second?

421
00:24:53,116 --> 00:24:54,159
[car door opens]

422
00:25:05,962 --> 00:25:08,798
[tense music playing]

423
00:25:08,882 --> 00:25:10,091
Step out of the car!

424
00:25:10,717 --> 00:25:12,219
-[car door opens]
-Step out!

425
00:25:17,682 --> 00:25:22,062
[tense music playing]

426
00:25:23,271 --> 00:25:24,314
[car door opens]

427
00:25:32,906 --> 00:25:34,032
Hold on.

428
00:25:34,699 --> 00:25:36,117
Can you take off your cap?

429
00:25:37,035 --> 00:25:38,161
Take off your cap!

430
00:25:41,289 --> 00:25:42,207
It's Diego!

431
00:25:46,753 --> 00:25:48,922
[grunts]

432
00:25:52,217 --> 00:25:53,885
[grunts]

433
00:25:58,807 --> 00:26:00,016
Hey! Stop right there!

434
00:26:00,100 --> 00:26:01,017
[Lily grunts]

435
00:26:03,270 --> 00:26:04,980
[Lily groaning in pain]

436
00:26:07,941 --> 00:26:09,901
Diego… Diego…

437
00:26:13,321 --> 00:26:16,950
[action music playing]

438
00:26:17,242 --> 00:26:18,994
[grunts]

439
00:26:24,040 --> 00:26:24,958
[grunts]

440
00:26:34,259 --> 00:26:35,802
Don't worry, Lily.

441
00:26:36,011 --> 00:26:39,431
We're already looking
for your husband Diego.

442
00:26:42,642 --> 00:26:43,685
Get up!

443
00:26:45,687 --> 00:26:46,730
Get up!

444
00:26:47,522 --> 00:26:48,565
Try to fight back!

445
00:26:54,154 --> 00:26:55,739
[gunshots]

446
00:27:00,869 --> 00:27:01,911
Hurry!

447
00:27:03,580 --> 00:27:04,956
-Hey! Stop!
-[gunshot]

448
00:27:16,217 --> 00:27:17,260
Very soon…

449
00:27:18,887 --> 00:27:20,555
you will be together.

450
00:27:21,306 --> 00:27:23,641
[groaning]

451
00:27:28,063 --> 00:27:30,899
Sleep, my dear. You need your rest.

452
00:27:32,233 --> 00:27:33,276
[snickers]

453
00:27:39,115 --> 00:27:44,662
[melodramatic music playing]

454
00:27:45,997 --> 00:27:53,838
[indistinct shouting]

455
00:28:05,600 --> 00:28:11,272
[shouting continues]

456
00:28:11,856 --> 00:28:12,899
<i>It's over, Lily.</i>

457
00:28:13,775 --> 00:28:20,573
[shouting continues]

458
00:28:26,704 --> 00:28:34,003
[soft piano music playing]

459
00:28:37,966 --> 00:28:42,887
[music swells]

460
00:29:34,898 --> 00:29:36,858
[music fades]

461
00:29:41,571 --> 00:29:47,452
[indistinct shouting]

462
00:29:49,120 --> 00:29:50,663
[man] You killed our mayor!

463
00:29:52,957 --> 00:29:55,293
-She should be killed!
-Kill her!

464
00:29:57,796 --> 00:29:59,464
[woman] You killed the mayor!

465
00:30:03,885 --> 00:30:05,720
[woman] Traitor! Kill her!

466
00:30:06,221 --> 00:30:09,432
[indistinct shouting continues]

467
00:30:11,184 --> 00:30:12,268
JUSTICE FOR MAYOR ARNALDO

468
00:30:14,687 --> 00:30:17,065
-You're scum!
-Monster!

469
00:30:17,148 --> 00:30:18,817
Look at her! She's a criminal!

470
00:30:20,735 --> 00:30:21,778
[woman] Criminal!

471
00:30:23,404 --> 00:30:26,074
-You're a murderer!
-Scum!

472
00:30:31,955 --> 00:30:32,956
Murderer!

473
00:30:34,791 --> 00:30:36,876
You killed our mayor!

474
00:30:38,628 --> 00:30:40,880
That woman has no soul!

475
00:30:41,256 --> 00:30:45,426
Criminal! Murderer!
You're the scum of this town!

476
00:30:45,510 --> 00:30:50,139
-You deserve to be punished!
-Right?! Punish the criminal!

477
00:30:51,015 --> 00:30:56,271
[indistinct shouting]

478
00:30:57,397 --> 00:30:59,941
-Scum!
-You should be killed!

479
00:31:00,733 --> 00:31:04,946
-Murderer! Criminal!
-You're scum!

480
00:31:07,907 --> 00:31:12,954
[indistinct shouting continues]

481
00:31:23,715 --> 00:31:25,466
-Kill her!
-Yeah!

482
00:31:28,970 --> 00:31:30,096
[woman] Monster!

483
00:31:30,179 --> 00:31:34,726
[indistinct shouting continues]

484
00:31:35,602 --> 00:31:41,566
[cheers and applause]

485
00:31:53,369 --> 00:32:01,252
[crowd chanting] Long live, Ardiente!

486
00:32:13,514 --> 00:32:20,480
[chanting continues]

487
00:32:21,230 --> 00:32:24,192
[cheers and applause]

488
00:32:30,990 --> 00:32:37,956
-Long live, Ardiente!
-Long live, Ardiente!

489
00:32:43,419 --> 00:32:45,254
Everyone!

490
00:32:45,338 --> 00:32:46,297
[shutter clicks]

491
00:32:47,507 --> 00:32:49,217
Behold…

492
00:32:50,218 --> 00:32:53,513
the cancer afflicting this town…

493
00:32:57,308 --> 00:32:59,143
Lily Cruz!

494
00:32:59,227 --> 00:33:00,853
[woman] Death penalty for Lily Cruz!

495
00:33:00,937 --> 00:33:02,480
She killed the mayor!

496
00:33:03,106 --> 00:33:06,192
[man] She killed the mayor! Death penalty!

497
00:33:06,651 --> 00:33:09,445
-You're a murderer!
-Murderer!

498
00:33:09,529 --> 00:33:10,947
-Punish her!
-Hang her!

499
00:33:11,030 --> 00:33:12,907
-Punish the murderer!
-Kill her!

500
00:33:13,408 --> 00:33:15,076
-Hang her upside down!
-Hang her!

501
00:33:15,159 --> 00:33:16,160
-You're a criminal!
-Scum!

502
00:33:16,244 --> 00:33:17,954
-Criminal!
-Punish her!

503
00:33:20,873 --> 00:33:23,626
-You're a criminal!
-Punish that woman!

504
00:33:31,634 --> 00:33:32,468
[Julio] Send her away.

505
00:33:36,180 --> 00:33:38,766
I'll avenge the mayor!

506
00:33:39,183 --> 00:33:40,935
You monster! You killed the mayor!

507
00:33:41,936 --> 00:33:46,691
[indistinct shouting continues]

508
00:33:48,860 --> 00:33:50,778
[man] Punish her! Hang her!

509
00:33:54,449 --> 00:33:55,700
[Julio] Lily Cruz…

510
00:33:57,660 --> 00:34:00,580
This is how you will meet your end.

511
00:34:00,997 --> 00:34:07,045
[tense music playing]

512
00:34:13,593 --> 00:34:15,178
You know, my sons and daughters…

513
00:34:16,220 --> 00:34:17,722
my dearest constituents…

514
00:34:18,598 --> 00:34:24,896
Our town lived in peace
until this woman came here.

515
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:28,024
We welcomed her to our town
with open arms.

516
00:34:29,108 --> 00:34:31,861
My family even welcomed her
into our very own house.

517
00:34:32,737 --> 00:34:37,825
We had no idea that this traitor
had an evil plan in mind:

518
00:34:38,701 --> 00:34:44,165
To kill your beloved Mayor Arnaldo.

519
00:34:48,795 --> 00:34:51,172
Lily Cruz…

520
00:34:52,215 --> 00:34:55,093
betrayed us all.

521
00:34:55,468 --> 00:34:59,639
-Kill her!
-Kill that woman!

522
00:35:01,516 --> 00:35:05,520
The traitor of Poblacion Ardiente!

523
00:35:05,603 --> 00:35:09,774
-Kill that woman!
-Scum!

524
00:35:10,233 --> 00:35:17,740
[indistinct shouting]

525
00:35:22,245 --> 00:35:25,414
[woman] How could you do that?!
You killed an innocent man!

526
00:35:26,582 --> 00:35:28,543
What do you want, Emilia?

527
00:35:30,837 --> 00:35:32,672
What do you want me to do?

528
00:35:34,841 --> 00:35:38,010
-Admit that you killed my son!
-[woman] She did!

529
00:35:38,094 --> 00:35:39,846
-[Emilia] Right, everyone?!
-[crowd] Yeah!

530
00:35:43,099 --> 00:35:45,643
[Emilia] Confess to everyone who's here,

531
00:35:45,726 --> 00:35:48,187
and then, get down on your knees.

532
00:35:48,271 --> 00:35:50,690
-[man] That's right!
-[woman] Kneel!

533
00:35:50,773 --> 00:35:53,109
[softly] Because if you don't,

534
00:35:53,192 --> 00:35:56,404
I will bring Diego here and parade him

535
00:35:56,487 --> 00:35:58,990
before all these people, just like you.

536
00:35:59,740 --> 00:36:01,284
So, kneel!

537
00:36:02,285 --> 00:36:05,872
-[man] Kneel, you monster!
-[woman] Kneel!

538
00:36:05,955 --> 00:36:08,916
You heard my daughter, woman!

539
00:36:12,211 --> 00:36:13,296
Kneel!

540
00:36:15,047 --> 00:36:17,550
[suspenseful music playing]

541
00:36:22,597 --> 00:36:23,764
Kneel!

542
00:36:26,392 --> 00:36:28,352
[Lily] <i>To save Diego…</i>

543
00:36:29,312 --> 00:36:32,690
<i>To rekindle the hope that will</i>
<i>end the people's suffering…</i>

544
00:36:34,192 --> 00:36:35,359
<i>I'll do it.</i>

545
00:36:35,443 --> 00:36:39,071
-[man] Kneel, now!
-[woman] Kneel down!

546
00:36:39,614 --> 00:36:40,948
You heard them, right?

547
00:36:43,367 --> 00:36:45,286
I said, kneel!

548
00:36:47,830 --> 00:36:49,874
[unsettling music swells]

549
00:36:50,958 --> 00:36:54,712
[crowd cheers and applauds]

550
00:36:54,795 --> 00:36:58,966
[indistinct shouting]

551
00:36:59,050 --> 00:37:00,259
[man] Kill her!

552
00:37:01,677 --> 00:37:09,018
[cheers and applause]

553
00:37:11,812 --> 00:37:13,814
-Kill that woman!
-Kill her!

554
00:37:14,357 --> 00:37:20,071
[cheers and applause]

555
00:37:27,995 --> 00:37:32,083
[indistinct shouting]

556
00:37:33,584 --> 00:37:34,961
[Julio] Look at me!

557
00:37:35,503 --> 00:37:38,130
Look at me! Huh?!

558
00:37:40,091 --> 00:37:44,136
[cheers and applause]

559
00:37:48,808 --> 00:37:51,978
[indistinct shouting]

560
00:37:52,478 --> 00:37:56,232
-Long live, Ardiente!
-Long live, Ardiente!

561
00:37:56,315 --> 00:38:03,990
[chanting] Long live, Ardiente!

562
00:38:06,909 --> 00:38:14,458
[crowd chanting] Hang her!

563
00:38:22,883 --> 00:38:25,553
-You murderer!
-Murderer!

564
00:38:27,096 --> 00:38:30,516
[indistinct shouting]

565
00:38:32,351 --> 00:38:33,602
Go on!

566
00:38:34,645 --> 00:38:39,608
[indistinct shouting]

567
00:38:47,867 --> 00:38:49,285
[sobbing]

568
00:38:51,537 --> 00:38:53,914
Lily! Lily…

569
00:38:54,457 --> 00:38:56,667
Lily! Get out of my way!

570
00:38:56,751 --> 00:38:59,462
-Where are you going?!
-Out of my way! Lily!

571
00:39:00,004 --> 00:39:02,590
Get out of my way! You monsters!

572
00:39:02,673 --> 00:39:04,467
Why are you hurting my daughter?!

573
00:39:04,925 --> 00:39:07,303
[Camia] Get out of my way, you monsters!

574
00:39:07,386 --> 00:39:08,512
Don't…

575
00:39:09,221 --> 00:39:11,390
-Stop right there!
-Don't you dare hurt her!

576
00:39:12,808 --> 00:39:14,810
[Camia sobbing]

577
00:39:14,894 --> 00:39:16,937
-Mom?
-Let go of me!

578
00:39:17,271 --> 00:39:18,647
-Mom.
-You monsters!

579
00:39:19,106 --> 00:39:21,275
Let her go, you monsters!

580
00:39:21,359 --> 00:39:22,401
Mom…

581
00:39:22,735 --> 00:39:23,778
[sobs] Lily…

582
00:39:25,321 --> 00:39:26,614
[Camia sobbing]

583
00:39:28,240 --> 00:39:29,200
[sobs] Lily…

584
00:39:29,283 --> 00:39:31,118
-She's innocent.
-Mom… Mom!

585
00:39:31,202 --> 00:39:33,120
-[Camia crying]
-Mom…

586
00:39:33,204 --> 00:39:35,581
[Emilia] How nice of your mother
to join us.

587
00:39:36,123 --> 00:39:38,334
[chuckles] What a sweet reunion.

588
00:39:40,002 --> 00:39:42,004
[Camia crying] Lily…

589
00:39:43,089 --> 00:39:45,341
Lily! Please let her go.

590
00:39:45,966 --> 00:39:46,842
Emilia…

591
00:39:48,427 --> 00:39:50,888
Not my mother. Hurt me instead.

592
00:39:51,222 --> 00:39:53,641
[sobbing] I'm begging you.

593
00:39:54,975 --> 00:39:55,976
Emilia.

594
00:39:58,938 --> 00:40:00,231
-[sobbing] She's innocent!
-Mom…

595
00:40:01,148 --> 00:40:02,024
Mom.

596
00:40:02,608 --> 00:40:03,984
-Lily!
-Stay.

597
00:40:04,527 --> 00:40:09,949
[melodramatic music playing]

598
00:40:11,367 --> 00:40:12,576
[Lily] Emilia!

599
00:40:14,662 --> 00:40:15,830
-Well?!
-Emilia!

600
00:40:17,164 --> 00:40:19,917
This isn't enough
for what you did to my son.

601
00:40:20,167 --> 00:40:21,877
-Since you made him suffer,
-[Lily] Don't, Emilia.

602
00:40:21,961 --> 00:40:24,046
-I'll make you suffer too!
-Emilia! Mom!

603
00:40:24,755 --> 00:40:26,674
Emilia! Don't!

604
00:40:29,093 --> 00:40:30,094
[crying]

605
00:40:30,970 --> 00:40:33,806
-I'm begging you…
-Stop this! Hurt me instead!

606
00:40:50,948 --> 00:40:54,535
[somber choral music playing]

607
00:40:55,286 --> 00:40:56,495
Marlon, Jepoy!

608
00:41:17,224 --> 00:41:18,142
[gun clicks]

609
00:41:29,487 --> 00:41:30,529
Anna, careful.

610
00:41:34,074 --> 00:41:41,373
[somber choral music playing]

611
00:41:51,300 --> 00:41:54,178
Ronald, what if my parents are down there?

612
00:41:54,929 --> 00:41:57,973
[Edna sobbing]

613
00:41:58,807 --> 00:41:59,850
Mom?

614
00:42:01,769 --> 00:42:02,895
[Edna sobbing]

615
00:42:02,978 --> 00:42:04,021
Dad?

616
00:42:04,271 --> 00:42:05,940
[Edna sobbing]

617
00:42:09,318 --> 00:42:12,112
The show is not over yet, wonder girl!

618
00:42:12,988 --> 00:42:14,782
-Mom.
-I'm begging you.

619
00:42:15,157 --> 00:42:17,409
Just stop this, you monsters!

620
00:42:18,327 --> 00:42:22,373
[ominous music playing]

621
00:42:25,042 --> 00:42:26,085
Lily…

622
00:42:30,589 --> 00:42:31,966
[melodramatic music playing]

623
00:42:32,049 --> 00:42:33,759
We are going for a walk.

624
00:42:34,301 --> 00:42:37,096
I'm going to escort you to hell!

625
00:42:38,013 --> 00:42:42,768
-Sounds good, everyone?
-Yes! For the mayor!

626
00:42:43,227 --> 00:42:46,730
[indistinct shouting]

627
00:42:47,147 --> 00:42:51,110
We're going to call this:
"The March of Sinners".

628
00:42:51,652 --> 00:42:53,571
[Camia] My daughter
didn't do anything wrong!

629
00:42:54,071 --> 00:42:55,781
She's innocent!

630
00:42:55,864 --> 00:42:59,410
You can't let the Ardientes
abuse their power!

631
00:42:59,493 --> 00:43:00,828
[sobs] You can't!

632
00:43:01,370 --> 00:43:02,830
Magbanua!

633
00:43:03,539 --> 00:43:04,748
Where is it?

634
00:43:05,541 --> 00:43:06,584
Move!

635
00:43:07,960 --> 00:43:08,877
Do you see this?!

636
00:43:08,961 --> 00:43:10,462
I AM A MURDERER
I KILLED YOUR MAYOR

637
00:43:11,130 --> 00:43:12,965
Put this around that woman's neck!

638
00:43:14,675 --> 00:43:16,302
-Mom…
-[Camia sobbing]

639
00:43:16,385 --> 00:43:18,804
[indistinct shouting]

640
00:43:19,722 --> 00:43:24,810
[Emilia slowly reading] "I am a murderer".

641
00:43:24,893 --> 00:43:26,562
I'M A MURDERER
I KILLED YOUR MAYOR

642
00:43:26,645 --> 00:43:28,230
Fits perfectly, right? All right then!

643
00:43:28,814 --> 00:43:30,149
Start marching!

644
00:43:30,232 --> 00:43:33,444
This is what criminals like you deserve.

645
00:43:33,527 --> 00:43:35,988
-Hurry up! Move!
-You deserve it!

646
00:43:36,071 --> 00:43:37,239
[Camia] Stop this!

647
00:43:38,407 --> 00:43:40,701
-You killed the mayor!
-She's a murderer!

648
00:43:41,327 --> 00:43:48,959
[somber music playing]

649
00:43:55,841 --> 00:43:58,719
What's wrong with you all?!
How could you?!

650
00:43:59,470 --> 00:44:02,306
My daughter sacrificed
so much for all of you!

651
00:44:02,556 --> 00:44:04,683
Are you all blind?! Open your eyes!

652
00:44:04,767 --> 00:44:08,354
Liars! Burn in hell!
She's nothing but a murderer!

653
00:44:08,437 --> 00:44:12,149
Liar! Stop spreading lies
about the Ardientes!

654
00:44:12,232 --> 00:44:13,442
Prove yourselves first!

655
00:44:13,525 --> 00:44:15,486
-You're all blind!
-Liar! Liar!

656
00:44:15,569 --> 00:44:17,863
[indistinct shouting]

657
00:44:17,946 --> 00:44:18,989
[woman] Kill her!

658
00:44:23,452 --> 00:44:24,495
[whip cracking]

659
00:44:25,954 --> 00:44:27,623
[whip cracking]

660
00:44:28,207 --> 00:44:29,208
-Kill her!
-[whip cracking]

661
00:44:29,291 --> 00:44:30,417
[man] You get what you deserve!

662
00:44:31,251 --> 00:44:32,294
[whip cracking]

663
00:44:35,881 --> 00:44:43,681
[indistinct shouting]

664
00:44:46,433 --> 00:44:47,643
[whip cracking]

665
00:44:49,728 --> 00:44:50,771
[whip cracking]

666
00:44:53,524 --> 00:44:56,276
[ominous music playing]

667
00:44:56,360 --> 00:44:57,361
[whip cracking]

668
00:45:01,949 --> 00:45:02,950
[whip cracking]

669
00:45:03,575 --> 00:45:06,370
-[whip cracking]
-[woman] No! Don't hurt Lily!

670
00:45:06,453 --> 00:45:08,414
-Take us instead!
-Have mercy on her!

671
00:45:08,497 --> 00:45:11,417
-Let Lily go! I beg you!
-You want to? Come here then!

672
00:45:11,500 --> 00:45:15,212
-Have mercy on her!
-Arrest them!

673
00:45:15,295 --> 00:45:17,005
-Please!
-We beg you!

674
00:45:18,006 --> 00:45:21,760
The Ardientes are the real murderers here!

675
00:45:21,844 --> 00:45:24,388
-You're the real crooks!
-Stop this, please!

676
00:45:24,471 --> 00:45:27,766
Please don't hurt Lily Cruz!
She's innocent!

677
00:45:28,308 --> 00:45:29,393
[whip cracking]

678
00:45:32,020 --> 00:45:34,022
-[whip cracking]
-[woman] Stop it, please!

679
00:45:36,567 --> 00:45:38,402
Have mercy on her! Please stop!

680
00:45:38,485 --> 00:45:39,528
[whip cracking]

681
00:45:42,865 --> 00:45:43,866
[whip cracking]

682
00:45:44,950 --> 00:45:51,915
[melodramatic music playing]

683
00:46:00,007 --> 00:46:01,633
[Jepoy] <i>Now is the time for change!</i>

684
00:46:01,717 --> 00:46:04,303
<i>-Down with the Ardientes!</i>
<i>-Down with the Ardientes!</i>

685
00:46:04,386 --> 00:46:05,888
[Magbanua] <i>Standing order</i>
<i>from the Governor:</i>

686
00:46:05,971 --> 00:46:07,890
<i>when the primary Tango arrives,</i>
<i>shoot to kill.</i>

687
00:46:07,973 --> 00:46:11,477
[Julio] <i>Blood will be paid with blood.</i>

688
00:46:11,560 --> 00:46:13,520
-[crowd shouting]
-<i>Stop this!</i>

689
00:46:13,604 --> 00:46:16,482
[Diego] <i>Thank you for gathering</i>
<i>the townspeople today!</i>

690
00:46:16,565 --> 00:46:20,277
<i>Now, they can see just how tainted</i>
<i>your souls really are!</i>

691
00:46:20,360 --> 00:46:21,612
<i>Arrest them! Arrest them all!</i>

692
00:46:21,695 --> 00:46:22,654
-[gunshot]
-[Emilia] <i>Papa!</i>

693
00:46:22,738 --> 00:46:24,281
-[gunshots]
-[people screaming]

694
00:46:24,364 --> 00:46:25,741
[Julio] <i>You ruined my family!</i>

695
00:46:25,824 --> 00:46:28,952
<i>You ruined the Ardientes!</i>
<i>This is your fault!</i>

696
00:46:29,036 --> 00:46:30,204
[stool clatters]

697
00:46:31,788 --> 00:46:35,834
[theme music playing]
